          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "ac13fb5c-9c5d-4554-a2ec-f72227b802ad",
                "quote": "不拉的話死的人更多",
                "start": 9,
                "end": 18
              },
              {
                "message_id": "16ec62e8-fbd5-48db-b868-02245bbb6fc0",
                "quote": "結果一樣是一個換五個",
                "start": 2,
                "end": 12
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "26a40b14-587b-4c05-af91-a89af5d2803b",
                "quote": "五個人比一個人多，救越多人越好",
                "start": 4,
                "end": 19
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "16ec62e8-fbd5-48db-b868-02245bbb6fc0",
                "quote": "結果一樣是一個換五個",
                "start": 2,
                "end": 12
              },
              {
                "message_id": "9c9d98b1-ec86-4ffa-a6ea-5a9d0f436052",
                "quote": "數字就是重點",
                "start": 18,
                "end": 24
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "eaf6d46c-e032-4dec-af74-93e488fd4c66",
                "quote": "感覺比較殘忍，但結果才是最重要的",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 16
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "student_id": "f399de5c-ee78-47df-a3c2-aef7fc2cb491",
        "display_name": "林雨潔",
        "scores": [
          {
            "dimension_index": 0,
            "score": 0.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "83f5e286-43fe-4b10-8f86-3ad7766979f4",
                "quote": "殺一個無辜的人就是錯的，這條線不能跨",
                "start": 7,
                "end": 25
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 0.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "3d0203dd-118d-47a7-8cb1-08330a05b35a",
                "quote": "拉了就是我殺了那個人",
                "start": 5,
                "end": 15
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 0.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "9f0e69a4-2003-4670-8bda-dc8314369844",
                "quote": "人不能被拿來當成救別人的工具",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 14
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 3.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "83f5e286-43fe-4b10-8f86-3ad7766979f4",
                "quote": "不管救幾個人，殺一個無辜的人就是錯的，這條線不能跨",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 25
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "31f4f01f-c8a8-4548-8071-f8da5df72c0d",
                "quote": "五個人會死是電車造成的，不是我。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 16
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "student_id": "adc20cfc-054b-45c5-8ab6-158eeb7f04bb",
        "display_name": "張家豪",
        "scores": [
          {
            "dimension_index": 0,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "203aeec9-eb64-4c92-95a9-0d584fc44ab1",
                "quote": "他的死就是手段",
                "start": 18,
                "end": 25
              },
              {
                "message_id": "9d664098-410f-45ca-8acc-7832c5e15bad",
                "quote": "那個人死是副作用，不是我想要他死",
